#Requires -Version 5.1
# generated by layoutswap: switch to Film night
# rendered 2026-09-09T14:32:05-05:00 with template version 2
#
# Self-contained: the interop code, the arrangement and the summary are embedded,
# so this file runs alone from a shortcut with the app closed. The app regenerates
# it when the template or the layout changes; do not edit it by hand.
#
# Steps: [1/3] Check monitors  [2/3] Apply arrangement  [3/3] Verify
# Progress lines read "[step/of] status text" where status is running, done,
# failed or skipped. Every other line is log. Every line also lands in switch.log
# beside this script, with a timestamp. Re-running a script whose arrangement is
# already applied skips the apply with a log line and verifies.
#
# Switches: -Pause keeps the console open at the end (shortcuts pass it);
# -ValidateOnly checks and validates but applies nothing, then verifies what is on now.
#
# Exit codes: 0 applied, 1 could not apply, 2 needed a user action.

param(
    [switch]$Pause,
    [switch]$ValidateOnly
)

#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# USER SETTINGS
#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$LayoutName    = 'Film night'
$LayoutId      = '0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef'
$CapturedAt    = '2026-09-09T14:33:00-05:00'
$AppRoot       = 'C:\Users\example\AppData\Local\layoutswap'
$MonitorsOn    = @(
